hadiths[55]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1080","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mar jae aur us ne ghazwa na kiya ho aur na apne nafs se us ki baat ki ho to woh nifaq ki ek shaakh par mara. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1081","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mushrikon se jihad karo apne maalon, apni janon aur apni zabanon se. Ise Ahmad aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1082","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya aurton par jihad hai? Aap ne farmaya: Han, jihad hai jis mein qital nahin hai: Hajj aur Umrah. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Bukhari mein hai."
"1083","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jo Aap se jihad mein ijazat mang raha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare walidain zinda hain? Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: To unhi mein jihad karo. Muttafaq alaih; aur Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ke han Abu Sa'id ki hadees se isi tarah hai aur izafa kiya: Wapas jao aur un se ijazat mango; phir agar woh tumhen ijazat den to warna un se neki karo."
"1084","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir Bajali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main har us Musalman se bari hun jo mushrikon ke darmiyan rehta hai. Ise Salasa ne riwayat kiya aur is ki sanad sahih hai; aur Bukhari ne is ke mursal hone ko tarjeeh di."
"1085","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fath ke baad hijrat nahin hai, lekin jihad aur niyyat hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1086","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo is liye lade ke Allah ka kalima buland ho woh Allah ke raste mein hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1087","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Sa'di (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hijrat qat' nahin hogi jab tak dushman se ladai ho. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1088","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Banu Mustaliq par hamla kiya jabke woh ghafil the; to un ke ladne walon ko qatl kiya aur un ke bachchon ko qaidi banaya. Mujhe yeh Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bataya. Muttafaq alaih; aur is mein hai ke us din Juwairiyah ko paya."
"1089","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sulaiman bin Buraidah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab lashkar par ameer banate to use Allah ke taqwe aur jo Musalman us ke sath hon un se khair ki wasiyat farmate, phir farmate: Allah ke naam se Allah ke raste mein ghazwa karo; jo Allah se kufr kare us se lado; ghazwa karo, khayanat na karo, dhoka na do, chehre na bigado, bachche ko qatl na karo; aur jab tum mushrikon mein se apne dushman se milo to unhen teen khaslaton ki taraf bulao; phir jo bhi woh tumhen jawab den use un se qabool karo aur un se ruko: Unhe Islam ki taraf bulao; phir agar woh tumhen jawab den to un se qabool karo. Phir unhen apne ghar se Muhajireen ke ghar ki taraf muntaqil hone ki da'wat do; phir agar inkar karen to unhen khabar do ke woh dehati Musalmanon ki tarah honge, aur un ke liye maal ghanimat aur fai mein kuch na hoga siwae is ke ke Musalmanon ke sath jihad karen. Phir agar woh inkar karen to un se jizyah mango; phir agar woh tumhen jawab den to un se qabool karo; phir agar inkar karen to Allah se madad mango aur un se lado. Aur jab tum qile walon ka muhasra karo aur woh tum se chahen ke un ke liye Allah aur Us ke Nabi ka zimma rakho to aisa na karo, lekin un ke liye apna zimma rakho; kyunke tumhara apne zimme todna is se halka hai ke tum Allah ka zimma todo; aur jab woh tum se chahen ke unhen Allah ke hukm par utaro to aisa na karo, balke apne hukm par; kyunke tum nahin jante ke tum un mein Allah ka hukm paoge ya nahin. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1090","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab kisi ghazwe ka irada farmate to us ke siwa ishara farmate. Muttafaq alaih."
"1091","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ma'qil se riwayat hai ke Nu'man bin Muqarrin ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke jab Aap din ke awwal mein na ladte to ladai ko moakhar farmate yahan tak ke suraj dhal jata, hawayen chaltin aur madad utarti. Ise Ahmad aur Salasa ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ki asl Bukhari mein hai."
"1092","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'b bin Jassamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mushrikon ke ghar ke bare mein poocha gaya jin par raat mein hamla kiya jata hai aur un ki aurton aur bachchon ko lagta hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Woh unhi mein se hain. Muttafaq alaih."
"1093","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us aadmi se farmaya jo Badr ke din Aap ke peeche aaya tha: Wapas jao, main mushrik se madad na lunga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1094","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne kisi ghazwe mein ek qatl ki hui aurat dekhi to aurton aur bachchon ke qatl ka inkar farmaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"1095","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mushrikon ke buddhon ko qatl karo aur un ke jawanon ko baqi rakho. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"1096","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh Badr ke din aamne samne aae. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ne ise taweel nikala."
"1097","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke yeh aayat hamare bare mein nazil hui, Ansar ki jama'at, yani: Aur apne hathon se halakat mein na pado [Surah Baqarah: 195]. Unhon ne yeh us ke radd mein kaha jis ne us par inkar kiya jo Room ki saf par hamla karke un mein dakhil hua. Ise Salasa ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi, Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1098","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Banu Nadir ki khajur jalai aur kati. Muttafaq alaih."
"1099","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khayanat na karo; kyunke ghulool apne walon par duniya aur aakhirat mein aag aur aar hai. Ise Ahmad aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1100","[AI-translation] Hazrat Awf bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qatil ke liye salb ka faisla farmaya. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Muslim ke han hai."
"1101","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Awf (Raziyallahu anhu) se Abu Jahl ke qatl ke qisse mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: To donon ne apni talwaron se us par pehal ki yahan tak ke use qatl kar diya; phir donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas wapas aae aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum donon mein se kis ne use qatl kiya? Kya tum ne apni talwaren ponchhin? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne un donon mein dekha aur farmaya: Tum donon ne use qatl kiya; us ka salb Mu'az bin Amr bin Jamuh ke liye hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1102","[AI-translation] Hazrat Makhul se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Taif par manjaniq nasab ki. Ise Abu Dawud ne Maraseel mein nikala, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain; aur Uqaili ne ise Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se za'if sanad se mausul kiya."
"1103","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Makkah mein dakhil hue jabke Aap ke sar par top tha. Phir jab use utara to ek aadmi Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ibn Khatal Ka'bah ke pardon se lipta hua hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Use qatl karo. Muttafaq alaih."
"1104","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Jubair se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Badr ke din teen ko qaid karke qatl kiya. Ise Abu Dawud ne Maraseel mein nikala, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain."
"1105","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Musalmanon ke do aadmiyon ke badle mushrikon ke ek aadmi ka fidya diya. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise sahih kaha; aur is ki asl Muslim ke han hai."
"1106","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sakhr bin Aylah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak qaum jab Musalman ho jae to apne khoon aur maal bacha leti hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal mawasooq hain."
"1107","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Badr ke qaidiyon ke bare mein farmaya: Agar Mut'im bin Adi zinda hota phir mujh se in gande logon ke bare mein baat karta to main unhen use chhor deta. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1108","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham ne Autas ke din qaidiyan pain jin ke shauhar the, to woh ruke. To Allah Ta'ala ne nazil farmaya: Aur shauhar wali aurtain siwae un ke jo tumhare dayen hath malik hon [Surah Nisa: 24]. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1109","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek dasta bheja aur main un mein tha Najd ki taraf; to unhon ne bahut unt ghanimat pae. To un ke hisse barah unt hue, aur unhen ek ek unt nafl diya gaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"1110","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke din ghode ke liye do hisse aur paidal ke liye ek hissa taqseem farmaya. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Abu Dawud ke han hai ke aadmi aur us ke ghode ke liye teen hisse diye: us ke ghode ke liye do hisse aur us ke liye ek hissa."
"1111","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ma'n bin Yazid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Nafl siwae khums ke baad nahin hai. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Tahawi ne ise sahih kaha."
"1112","[AI-translation] Hazrat Habib bin Maslamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap ne shuru mein chauthai nafl diya aur wapasi mein tahai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Jarud, Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1113","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un mein se kuch ko nafl dete jinhen dastat mein bhejte un ke liye khaas taur par, aam lashkar ki taqseem ke siwa. Muttafaq alaih."
"1114","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke ham apne ghazwon mein shehed aur angoor pate to use khate aur use na uthate. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ke han hai ke un se khums na liya gaya. Aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1115","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Awfa (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ham ne Khaibar ke din khana paya; to aadmi aata aur us mein se jitna use kafi hota leta, phir wapas jata. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Jarud aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1116","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ruwaifi' bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho woh Musalmanon ke fai ki sawari par sawar na ho yahan tak ke jab use laghar kar de to use us mein wapas kare; aur Musalmanon ke fai ka kapda na pahne yahan tak ke jab use purana kar de to use us mein wapas kare. Ise Abu Dawud aur Darimi ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal mein harj nahin hai."
"1117","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ubaidah bin Jarrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Musalmanon mein se ba'z un par panah deta hai. Ise Ibn Abi Shaibah aur Ahmad ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein za'f hai; aur Tayalisi ke han Amr bin Aas ki hadees se hai: Musalmanon mein se adna un par panah deta hai. Aur Sahihain mein Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se hai ke Musalmanon ka zimma ek hai."
"1118","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Main Yahud aur Nasara ko Jazirat al-Arab se zaroor nikalunga yahan tak ke siwae Musalman ke koi na chhorun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1119","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Banu Nadir ke maal us mein se the jo Allah ne Apne Rasool par fai kiya, us mein se jo Musalmanon ne ghode ya unt se hasil na kiya tha. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye khaas the; to Aap apne ghar walon par saal bhar ka kharch farmate, aur jo bachta use ghode aur hathyar mein Allah ke raste ki tayyari mein lagate. Muttafaq alaih."
"1120","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Khaibar mein ghazwa kiya to ham ne us mein bakriyan pain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham mein ek giroh taqseem farmaya aur baqi ko maal ghanimat mein rakha. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal mein harj nahin hai."
"1121","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Rafi' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ahad ko nahin todta aur qasidon ko nahin rokta. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1122","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi basti mein tum aao aur us mein thehro to us mein tumhara hissa hai; aur jo bhi basti Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani kare us ka khums Allah aur Us ke Rasool ke liye hai, phir woh tumhare liye hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1123","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Awf (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use liya, yani jizyah, Hajar ke Majoos se. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur is ka ek tareeq Muwatta mein hai jis mein inqita hai."
"1124","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asim bin Umar se Anas se, aur Usman bin Abi Sulaiman se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khalid bin Waleed ko Ukaidir Dumah ki taraf bheja to unhon ne use pakda; phir us ka khoon bachaya aur us se jizyah par sulah ki. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"1125","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe Yaman bheja aur hukm diya ke har baligh se ek dinar ya us ke barabar mu'afiri lun. Ise Salasa ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1126","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aaiz bin Amr Muzani (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Islam buland hota hai aur buland nahin kiya jata. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya."
"1127","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yahud aur Nasara ko salam mein pehal na karo; aur jab tum un mein se kisi se raste mein milo to use us ke tang hisse ki taraf karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1128","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miswar bin Makhramah aur Marwan se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hudaibiyah ke saal nikle... Phir taweel hadees zikr ki, aur is mein hai: Yeh hai jis par Muhammad bin Abdullah ne Suhail bin Amr se sulah ki: Dus saal tak jang rokne par, jis mein log aman mein rahen aur ek doosre se ruke rahen. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Bukhari mein hai; aur Muslim ne nikala."
"1129","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo mu'ahid ko qatl kare woh jannat ki khushbu na payega, halanke us ki khushbu chalis saal ki musafat se pai jati hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1130","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tayyar ghodon se daud karai Hafya se, aur us ki had Saniyat al-Wada thi. Aur un ghodon ke darmiyan daud karai jo tayyar na the, Saniyah se Banu Zuraiq ki masjid tak. Aur Ibn Umar un mein the jo daud mein the. Muttafaq alaih; Bukhari ne izafa kiya ke Sufyan ne kaha: Hafya se Saniyat al-Wada tak."
"1131","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghodon ke darmiyan daud karai aur quruh ko had mein fazilat di. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1132","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Daud siwae khuff, naizah ya ghode mein nahin hai. Ise Ahmad aur Salasa ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1133","[AI-translation] Unhin se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo do ghodon ke darmiyan ghoda dakhil kare jabke use aman na ho ke peeche reh jae to harj nahin hai; aur agar aman ho to woh juwa hai. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad za'if hai."
"1134","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mimbar par padhte suna: Aur un ke liye jitni taqat ho tayyar karo [Surah Anfal: 60]; khabardar! Beshak quwwat teer-andazi hai, khabardar! Beshak quwwat teer-andazi hai, khabardar! Beshak quwwat teer-andazi hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
